Package: desk-focus-tracker
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Chintan Diwakar
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgl1, libglib2.0-0t64, libglib2.0-bin, libsm6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, xdg-utils
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Local desk-focus tracker
 Desk Focus Tracker uses local camera inference to estimate focused,
 possible phone-use, uncertain, and away time. It does not save frames.
